nd other mainstream image formats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Real-time preview - Instantly view effects and quickly adjust parameters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Clean interface - Intuitive user interface that is easy to use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Efficient processing - Optimized with OpenCV for fast processing speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe High-quality output - Maintains the best image quality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Cases</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game development: Create a consistent pixel art style for your 2D games and quickly prototype characters and scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art creation: Transform photos into retro pixel art and explore new possibilities in digital art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design work: Add unique retro aesthetics to your projects and create eye-catching visual effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning and practice: Understand the principles of pixel art and improve your digital art skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
